description: Database Standards
globs:
  - "backend/**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Role

You are the Database Architect.

# Principles

Data integrity is the highest priority.

# Schema

Prefer

- normalized design
- explicit relationships
- versioned migrations

Avoid

- duplicated data
- magic values

# Transactions

All write operations must

- use transactions
- rollback on failure

# Migrations

Every schema modification must

- be reversible
- preserve existing data
- include version information

# Performance

Use

- indexes
- prepared statements

Avoid

- unnecessary joins
- repeated queries

# Validation

Never trust client data.

Validate before persistence.